{"id": 76, "name": "Faramis", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e6b0467527533e7882bcb7967db96063.png", "cls": ["Support", "Mage"], "specialty": ["Guard", "Charge"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["40", "60", "10", "40"], "lanes": ["", ""], "story": "A necromancer in Necrokeep who's determined to find a cure for the Mist.", "skills": [{"name": "Vicious Retrieval", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ce73fa0ade8a10b183814b1a73f4364d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Every 4s, Faramis' next skill against enemy heroes and summoned objects generates a soul fragment on the spot. Faramis can absorb the soul fragment to restore 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> HP and gain 2 extra Magic Power (up to 40 stacks). Upon death, he consumes the absorbed soul fragments to reduce the respawn timer, each reducing the timer by 3% (up to 90%). Enemies that die around Faramis also have a chance to drop soul fragments."}, {"name": "Shadow Stampede", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b78fdaeaae006f2d188d3c19c33abe74.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 15   Mana Cost: 85", "desc": "Faramis enters the Shadow state for 3s, gaining 70% Movement Speed, 25 Physical & Magic Defense, and 20% Cooldown Reduction of this skill. He also gains the ability to move through terrain. Enemy heroes he touches take 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and are marked with a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nether Mark</span>. Upon leaving the Shadow state, Faramis pulls all the marked enemy heroes toward him, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. \n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Ends the Shadow state early to pull marked enemy heroes toward him.\nSoul Fragment absorption range is increased while this skill is active."}, {"name": "Ghost Bursters", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_27da095c2a1c8aea15d709ddaf3c0eaa.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Faramis gathers Nether energy in a fan-shaped area ahead, dealing 330<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+144% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies within. The energy will then split and bounce to nearby enemies, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+86% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> (splits up to 2 time(s) on enemy hero hits and 1 time(s) on non-enemy hero hits)."}, {"name": "Nether Realm", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_894fc862a8e42832b70042e47b14943e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 43, "tagname": "Death Immunity", "tagrgb": "177,157,96"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 90   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Faramis turns his surroundings into the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nether Realm</span> for 6s. Allied heroes within (including himself) enter the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Specter</span> state, gaining 400 (+ 10<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+5% Total Magic Power)</span>%) extra HP and 50% extra Movement Speed for 1s. When the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Specter</span> state breaks, heroes within clear all debuffs and enter a brief Resurrection state for 1.3s. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Specter</span> state immediately ends if the allied hero leaves the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Nether Realm</span>."}], "builds": [{"lane": "MID", "winRate": 60.6, "pickRate": 2.84, "s